        <profile name="Loyal Servant" id="7d32-f3a0-e93f-403a" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When a friendly &lt;ORDO&gt; INQUISITOR model within 3” of this unit would lose any wounds as a result of an attack made against that model, this unit can attempt to intercept that attack. Roll one D6; on a 2+ that model does not lose those wounds and one model from this unit is destroyed. Only one attempt can be made to intercept each attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Agent" id="0a60-ac1c-af20-b7c8" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">If this unit contains 1 Acolyte at the start of battle, it gains the CHARACTER keyword.</characteristic>
