                <characteristic name="Details" typeId="ad96-dfa4-b4ed-656d">Blessing: If manifested, select one friendly IMPERIUM INFANTRY or IMPERIUM BIKER unit within 12&quot; of this psyker. Until the start of your next Psychic phase, models in that unit have a 5+ invulnerable save.</characteristic>
